{"seq":1,"slug":"sliding-window-algorithm","title":"滑动窗口算法：精确限流的完整实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/implementation/sliding-window-algorithm","wordCount":883,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"滑动窗口算法-精确限流的完整实现\">滑动窗口算法：精确限流的完整实现</h1><p>滑动窗口是解决固定窗口「边界突刺」问题的标准方案。它以当前时刻为基准，向前追溯固定时长，只统计这个动态区间内的请求数——窗口随时间「滑动」，始终包含最近 N 秒的请求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>滑动窗口通过以当前时刻为基准向前追溯固定时长，动态计算区间内的请求数，彻底消除固定窗口的边界突刺问题。两种工程实现路径各有权衡：<strong>精确实现</strong>（ZSET 存储时间戳）保证无误差但内存随请求数增长；<strong>近似实现</strong>（双计数器加权）用 O(1) 空间换取约 5% 的精度损失。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[当前时间 T=65s] --&gt; B{滑动窗口&lt;br/&gt;60s}&#10;    B --&gt; C[有效区间&lt;br/&gt;5s - 65s]&#10;    C --&gt; D[精确实现&lt;br/&gt;ZSET 统计时间戳]&#10;    C --&gt; E[近似实现&lt;br/&gt;双计数器加权]&#10;    D --&gt; F[误差=0&lt;br/&gt;内存线性增长]&#10;    E --&gt; G[误差约5%&lt;br/&gt;内存常量]\">graph LR\n    A[当前时间 T=65s] --&gt; B{滑动窗口&lt;br/&gt;60s}\n    B --&gt; C[有效区间&lt;br/&gt;5s - 65s]\n    C --&gt; D[精确实现&lt;br/&gt;ZSET 统计时间戳]\n    C --&gt; E[近似实现&lt;br/&gt;双计数器加权]\n    D --&gt; F[误差=0&lt;br/&gt;内存线性增长]\n    E --&gt; G[误差约5%&lt;br/&gt;内存常量]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>精确度</th>\n<th>内存复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基于有序集合（精确）</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>O(n·请求数)</td>\n<td>安全敏感接口、审计需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基于计数器近似（高效）</td>\n<td>~95%</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>高并发 API、Nginx 场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"两种实现策略\">两种实现策略</h2><p>滑动窗口有两种工程实现路径，各有权衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>精确度</th>\n<th>内存复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基于有序集合（精确）</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>O(n·请求数)</td>\n<td>安全敏感接口、审计需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基于计数器近似（高效）</td>\n<td>~95%</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>高并发 API、Nginx 场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"精确实现-基于有序集合\">精确实现：基于有序集合</h2><h3 id=\"核心思路\">核心思路</h3><p>用 Redis 有序集合（ZSET）存储每个请求的时间戳，score 和 member 都设为时间戳（加上随机后缀避免重复）。查询时，只计算 <code>[now - window, now]</code> 区间内的成员数量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- sliding_window_exact.lua&#10;-- KEYS[1]: 限流键（如 &quot;rl:user:123:/api/search&quot;）&#10;-- ARGV[1]: 窗口大小（毫秒）&#10;-- ARGV[2]: 限制数量&#10;-- ARGV[3]: 当前时间戳（毫秒）&#10;-- ARGV[4]: 唯一请求 ID&#10;&#10;local key = KEYS[1]&#10;local window_ms = tonumber(ARGV[1])&#10;local limit = tonumber(ARGV[2])&#10;local now = tonumber(ARGV[3])&#10;local req_id = ARGV[4]&#10;local window_start = now - window_ms&#10;&#10;-- 删除过期的请求记录&#10;redis.call(&#39;ZREMRANGEBYSCORE&#39;, key, &#39;-inf&#39;, window_start)&#10;&#10;-- 统计窗口内的请求数&#10;local count = redis.call(&#39;ZCARD&#39;, key)&#10;&#10;if count &gt;= limit then&#10;  -- 超限：返回 0 和需等待毫秒数&#10;  local oldest = redis.call(&#39;ZRANGE&#39;, key, 0, 0, &#39;WITHSCORES&#39;)&#10;  local wait_ms = 0&#10;  if #oldest &gt;= 2 then&#10;    wait_ms = tonumber(oldest[2]) + window_ms - now&#10;  end&#10;  return {0, math.max(0, wait_ms)}&#10;end&#10;&#10;-- 记录本次请求&#10;redis.call(&#39;ZADD&#39;, key, now, req_id)&#10;-- 设置过期时间（窗口时长的 2 倍）&#10;redis.call(&#39;PEXPIRE&#39;, key, window_ms * 2)&#10;&#10;return {1, 0}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- sliding_window_exact.lua</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- KEYS[1]: 限流键（如 \"rl:user:123:/api/search\"）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- ARGV[1]: 窗口大小（毫秒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- ARGV[2]: 限制数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- ARGV[3]: 当前时间戳（毫秒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- ARGV[4]: 唯一请求 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local key = KEYS[1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local window_ms = tonumber(ARGV[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local limit = tonumber(ARGV[2])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local now = tonumber(ARGV[3])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local req_id = ARGV[4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local window_start = now - window_ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 删除过期的请求记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('ZREMRANGEBYSCORE', key, '-inf', window_start)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 统计窗口内的请求数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local count = redis.call('ZCARD', key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if count >= limit then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  -- 超限：返回 0 和需等待毫秒数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  local oldest = redis.call('ZRANGE', key, 0, 0, 'WITHSCORES')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  local wait_ms = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if #oldest >= 2 then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    wait_ms = tonumber(oldest[2]) + window_ms - now</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return {0, math.max(0, wait_ms)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 记录本次请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('ZADD', key, now, req_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 设置过期时间（窗口时长的 2 倍）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('PEXPIRE', key, window_ms * 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return {1, 0}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"node-js-封装\">Node.js 封装</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { createClient } from &#39;redis&#39;;&#10;import { readFileSync } from &#39;fs&#39;;&#10;&#10;const script = readFileSync(&#39;./sliding_window_exact.lua&#39;, &#39;utf-8&#39;);&#10;&#10;class SlidingWindowExact {&#10;  constructor(redis, opts) {&#10;    this.redis = redis;&#10;    this.windowMs = opts.windowMs;&#10;    this.limit = opts.limit;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async isAllowed(key) {&#10;    const now = Date.now();&#10;    const reqId = `${now}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2)}`;&#10;&#10;    const result = await this.redis.eval(script, {&#10;      keys: [key],&#10;      arguments: [String(this.windowMs), String(this.limit), String(now), reqId],&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;      allowed: result[0] === 1,&#10;      retryAfterMs: result[1],&#10;      // 查询当前使用量（精确）&#10;      remaining: this.limit - (await this.redis.zCard(key)),&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createClient } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'redis'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { readFileSync } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> script</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> readFileSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./sliding_window_exact.lua'</span><span style=\"c